    "long_instructions": "# Debug the Errors\r\n\r\nWith the help of AI, find and fix the bugs (errors) in `script.js` causing the website  not to work as expected. Make sure to tackle one bug at a time and save your changes as you go.\r\n\r\n_Hint: Use the comments above each code snippet to help you understand what the code should be doing._\r\n\r\n:::details [Not sure where to start?]\r\nTry clicking different buttons and noting what does not work as expected.\r\n:::",
